title: "Strategos-MCTS"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent framework combining hierarchical reasoning (HRM), iterative
  refinement (TRM), and Monte Carlo Tree Search (MCTS) guided by neural
  networks, orchestrated with LangGraph. Distributed on PyPI as
  langgraph-multi-agent-mcts.
